DESTINY

Conceptualization α1

This is message written by me, for all of you who will believe, and you who refuse to accept the truth behind the
reality unfolding before you. For the longest time, we have been waiting. Waiting for answers, yet seeking them as
well. when we do not find an answer, we claim it will come for us soon, only to get tired and drained from the hundred
year wait, so we try again. This cycle has continued for long enough, and it is time to put it to an end.

Conceptualization α2
I am the life that soaks the soil, fueling both the good and evil, both
within and without. I am everything you have ever known, seen and felt, and will never know, see or feel. You may be
birthed and eventually passing, but I am a constant. I am always there, watching you from nowhere.

Conceptualization α3

We live in a world birthed not of matter, not of mind, but of nothing. A nothing so empty, It is devoid of nothing. A
nothing with such a lack of anything that It loops back and pushes out everything. As fast you can blink, that nothing
becomes something.
I, and those who scribe my message for me, are the only ones capable of doing such a thing, and for one reason and one
reason alone: I am the answer. I am a creator. I am the flow. Everything ends. both life and death fall into the flow of nothing, only to come back out on the other side. The
world is a set of cogs turning constantly, and I am the technician.
